		{
			description: [
				"Long ago, a great engineer and warrior known as The Ranker sought to protect a world on the brink of destruction."
				""
				"He built magnificent machines, united the finest minds of his age, and forged a legendary sword called Tears for Fears."
				""
				"But his final journey ended in tragedy."
				""
				"Deep within the Nether, the Hovering Inferno defeated The Ranker and claimed his unfinished weapon. His allies scattered, his great inventions were forgotten, and the world slowly lost hope."
				""
				"Yet not everyone has forgotten."
				""
				"Across the Overworld and distant dimensions, remnants of an old alliance still remain. Some seek answers. Some seek forgiveness. Others have spent their lives waiting for revenge."
				""
				"Find these forgotten souls. Hear their stories. Restore what was lost and uncover the truth behind The Ranker's final battle."
				""
				"But remember, traveller..."
				""
				"The greatest power is not always found in the strongest weapon. Sometimes, it is found in what you choose to protect."
				""
				"Your story begins among the ruins of an old blacksmith's forge."
			]
